   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb (Premium)<br>\n<strong>Type:</strong> External Body Cyberware<br>\n<strong>Install:</strong> Mall<br>\n<strong>Humanity Loss:</strong> 3 (1d6)<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> uses 1</p>\n<p>External Body Cyberware. While active it masks the user's face from anything looking at them, cameras included. Anyone making a Human Perception or Lip Reading check against them takes -2. Set to the right display, it counts as an instance of Gang Colors Jewelry for Scavengers. Switching it on or off takes an Action.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The -2 applies to other people's checks, so it can't be automated from this item.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; External Body Cyberware).</em></p>"
